lee: Getting crash in Expo DevClient when calling SDK init in edge mode — `crypto.getRandomValues is not a function`
joel: same, only reproducible on Hermes/Expo, not in node or web. stack: `TypeError: crypto.getRandomValues is not a function`
kevin: quick workaround: `import 'react-native-get-random-values'` before any lib that uses crypto. Works for RN native randoms.
lee: tried that, still fails when SDK resolves to .mjs entry (metro fails to handle .mjs import)
kevin: ah, SDK's package "exports" points to `dist/edge/index.mjs` — metro doesn't like .mjs. Use dynamic import workaround: `await import('@redwood/inference/dist/edge/index.mjs')`? but metro can't load mjs either.
maria: filing an SDK issue. we should add a `react-native` entrypoint + CJS fallback. I'll open GH issue and tag infra.
maria: https://github.com/redwood-inference/sdk-js/issues/512 — includes repro steps and Hermes+Expo repro app :eyes: 
joel: metro config hack that helped me:
```js
// metro.config.js
module.exports = {
  resolver: {
    sourceExts: ['js', 'json', 'ts', 'tsx', 'cjs', 'mjs'],
    extraNodeModules: { crypto: require.resolve('react-native-crypto') },
  },
};
```
kevin: also add `react-native-get-random-values` at top of entrypoint and add global polyfill:
```js
import 'react-native-get-random-values';
global.crypto = global.crypto || {};
crypto.getRandomValues = crypto.getRandomValues || global.getRandomValuesFromExpo;
```
lee: that feels hacky — SDK should not require app-side hacks. Could we publish `dist/rn/index.cjs` and set `exports.{"react-native": "dist/rn/index.cjs"}`?
kevin: agreed. also need typings for the RN entry so TS projects don't pull the ESM types with Node-only APIs.
maria: plan: 1) publish RN entrypoint CJS, 2) include `react-native` export in package.json, 3) add README RN quickstart + metro snippet, 4) add e2e test on Expo DevClient CI. assigning to @kevin for PR.
kevin: will start a branch. in meantime, if you hit the crash DM me stack and bundle snapshot. :thumbsup: 
expo-bot: New Expo reproducer uploaded by lee — https://expo.dev/artifacts/abcd1234
lee: thanks all — removing hack and waiting for PR. :wave:
